# Images and media

- Set `width` and `height` or `aspect-ratio` so layout does not jump (CLS).
- Hero / LCP image: not `loading="lazy"`. Below the fold — lazy.
- Important LCP image may use `fetchpriority="high"`.
- Raster: modern formats (WebP/AVIF) with a fallback; `srcset`/`sizes` if the image stretches.
- Informative `alt`. Decor — empty alt. Do not write “image” / “picture” in alt.
- Video: no autoplay sound. Autoplay only muted and with controls. Content video — captions.
- Do not use a heavy GIF if video will do. Do not ship a giant PNG without need.
